== Summary ==
Historical full-card composite of [[Luke Skywalker (V) (Virtual Set 1) (Errata 2)|Luke Skywalker from Original Virtual Set 1]], distributed through the [[Holotable]] large-image package through Virtual Set 17. Original bytes are retained, including the frame/slip seam and printed card number 05. It matches the later [[:File:VS1O-05-Luke_Skywalker.png|publisher slip]] numbered 05 in game text and statistics.

